WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.790
You make something beautiful...

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.350
then you lose HOURS,

3
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.790
just trying to sell it.

4
00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:10.580
Photos. Titles. Tags.

5
00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:15.040
Answering messages... and then doing it

6
00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:17.560
all again, on the next website.

7
00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:19.950
So here's my idea.

8
00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:23.370
She fills in ONE simple sheet...

9
00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:26.410
and my tools turn it into

10
00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:27.570
listings for Etsy...

11
00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:29.930
eBay... and Amazon.

12
00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:33.420
AI writes the titles and tags

13
00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:36.180
that buyers actually search for.

14
00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:39.280
And one phone photo becomes clean,

15
00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.340
bright shop photos.

16
00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:43.910
And when a buyer asks...

17
00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:45.790
is this still available?

18
00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:48.730
A friendly answer goes back in

19
00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:51.990
seconds. Even at two in the

20
00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:52.370
morning.

21
00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:55.560
Every order lands in one list.

22
00:00:56.690 --> 00:00:58.140
Stock counts update themselves.

23
00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:00.140
And each morning,

24
00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:02.940
she sees exactly what to post.

25
00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:05.110
Less time on the screen.

26
00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:06.970
More time making.

27
00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:08.990
That's the whole point.
